comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-29T04:49:40.386Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check before create: pm-oi4zs3 is CLOSED and made lean reads OMIT caller echoes, which is the opposite operation to declaring an omission; pm-cyrfjq owns envelopes that report a count beside an empty array, a defect this receipt would expose rather than a receipt; pm-pjnu91 owns the three incompatible list-family projections, which is about which fields are chosen and not about disclosing the choice; pm-sb0tns owns the row contract and the --fields axis. Searched keyword and semantic for omission receipt, projection declaration, withheld fields; inspected the live envelopes of list, context, activity, search and get to confirm five distinct behaviours."
